Z||000003||AusFiero||08-18-2001||01:23 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MinnGreenGT:<BR><B>AUS...<P>Thanks for the pic-looks great.  Sorry to hear about your wife.  Hope she's feeling better soon!<P>-Rob</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yep she is feeling better Rob. Have to go pick her up. Might drop the kids and their nannas though to give her and ok, me some peace for a while. They have just drugged my wife up with painkillers for now and are sending her home pending more tests. But sheeeez I coulda doped he up to the eyeballs here with painkillers, I certainly have enough choice lately.  And WOOHOO I hadn't tested my USB port since getting it fixed Wednesday. The pictures come out super high resolution, as they should from a 3.1 megapixel camera. That picture was 2140 X 1440 before I shrunk and cropped it. Was the first time I have take a picture into my pute from my new camera.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
