Z||000007||AusFiero||08-18-2001||04:48 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by pontiacs4me:<BR><B>Hey Aus,<P>How long is the waiting list now?  I know youre only going to be making 5 sets a week, and the longer I wait to put in my order, the longer Ill be waiting, for sure.  Im still saving up to buy them, can I pay you in payments or something?  I may be painting this guys integra soon, and he is paying me $500 so if that deal works out Im set.  Thanks.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The list is 2 weeks long now P4me. I will start shipping this week. Well as long as I strike no more initial glitches like sick wives, sleep clinics and bad weather trying to blow my house away.<BR>You can join the list with only a 10% of 34.00. You would be looking at about a 3 week wait then. If you didn't have the money then I could just keep bumping you down the list until your ready. <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com/fierostore/ezistore.cgi" TARGET=_blank>http://www.auto-alley.com/fierostore/ezistore.cgi</A>  will get you inside the store as I currently have the front entrance closed while i move it all and other things to <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroshop.com.au</A> <BR>Cheers<BR>Jim<P>||||reg||1
